      "effectSize": "NFIL3-knockout CAR-T cells showed prolonged activity, greater proliferation and improved tumor control across multiple mouse models, extending survival (directional outcomes; no single percentage reported)",
      "diseaseBurden": "Solid tumors account for ~90% of human cancers; CAR-T is currently approved only for certain blood cancers, leaving most cancer types without a cell-therapy option",
